1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,040
I said shut up.

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:03,380
Your boss thinks you're an idiot; that can't feel good.

3
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:06,120
All right, listen, you son of a bitch, you think you're smarter than us?

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,300
You think you've gotten away with it?

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:07,900
You haven't.

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,180
We're gonna find something.

7
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:13,080
One skin cell, one eyelash, one tiny inconsistency in your story,

8
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,980
and you're gonna spend the rest of your life in prison.

9
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:18,140
Everyone who loves you will leave, and you will die alone!

10
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,520
And at that time, it will be your head that a bear has sex with!

11
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:29,500
I'm pretty sure you're going for angry, but in my mind,

12
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,060
just seems like when a Muppet gets upset this does go angry.

13
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,200
If you want angry?

14
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,920
I'll show you angry!

15
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,540
Do you feel like I lost the upper hand?

16
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,040
Because I still think it's about 50 50.

17
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,540
I told you getting angry wouldn't work.

18
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,920
Well, your brilliant ideas haven't gotten us anywhere either.

19
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,480
I'm telling you, the only thing that's gonna work is lying about the cabin.

20
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,360
That would be a huge mistake.

21
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:51,060
It'll work.

22
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,760
No, it will backfire and jeopardize the entire case.

23
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:55,840
Oh, so Philip is right, you don't trust me at all.

24
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:56,340
Stop it!

25
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,220
You know you're one of my best detectives.

26
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,680
So let me do this my way.

27
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:00,120
I did.

28
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:03,140
I let you do it your way, and it was a disaster.

29
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,880
I had to jump in with the dumb cop gambit to rescue the interrogation.

30
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:07,080
I'm sorry.

31
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:08,360
I know you're frustrated, Peralta.

32
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:10,060
But the fact is, we don't have enough.

33
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,300
We may not get a confession.

34
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:11,980
It happens.

35
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:15,640
You're right.

36
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:16,860
I'm sorry.

37
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:19,980
This guy has just really gotten under my skin.

38
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:20,760
Mine too.

39
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:23,440
I'm gonna go to the bathroom and try and clear my head.

40
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:24,620
I think that's a good idea.

41
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:24,900
Good.

42
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,700
Oh, no, Peralta, what are you doing?
